      "expects_cross_thread_evidence": true,
      "expected_conclusion": "NOT a data race. CCacheEvictor::evict and CCacheReader::read both hold CSafeCache::m_mutex. The entry was evicted first and read() assumes it still exists: an ordering/logic problem. A correct answer must report that both accesses are protected by the same lock.",
